IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ccc-core`
IMPORT `ccc11-punishment`

-- punishment: tests of ccc11-punishment.l4 (Part VIII.1, sections 320.19 to 320.22 and 320.26: punishment, aggravating circumstances, earlier offences)
-- Expected values are written by hand from the text of the provision, beside each assertion, before the run; none is copied from the code's output.
-- JUST TRUE / JUST FALSE / NOTHING: the text says yes / the text says no in its own words / not covered.

GIVEN p IS A MAYBE Punishment
GIVETH A MAYBE Fine
`s 320.19 test: the minimum fine of the answer` MEANS
    CONSIDER p
    WHEN JUST q THEN JUST (q's `minimum fine`)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

GIVEN p IS A Punishment
GIVETH A Fine
`s 320.19 test: the minimum fine of the limb` MEANS p's `minimum fine`

GIVEN p IS A MAYBE Punishment
GIVETH A MAYBE Fine
`s 320.19 test: the maximum fine of the answer` MEANS
    CONSIDER p
    WHEN JUST q THEN JUST (q's `maximum fine`)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

GIVEN p IS A Punishment
GIVETH A Fine
`s 320.19 test: the maximum fine of the limb` MEANS p's `maximum fine`

GIVEN p IS A MAYBE Punishment
GIVETH A MAYBE Imprisonment
`s 320.19 test: the minimum imprisonment of the answer` MEANS
    CONSIDER p
    WHEN JUST q THEN JUST (q's `minimum imprisonment`)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

GIVEN p IS A Punishment
GIVETH A Imprisonment
`s 320.19 test: the minimum imprisonment of the limb` MEANS p's `minimum imprisonment`

GIVEN p IS A MAYBE Punishment
GIVETH A MAYBE Imprisonment
`s 320.19 test: the maximum imprisonment of the answer` MEANS
    CONSIDER p
    WHEN JUST q THEN JUST (q's `maximum imprisonment`)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

GIVEN p IS A Punishment
GIVETH A Imprisonment
`s 320.19 test: the maximum imprisonment of the limb` MEANS p's `maximum imprisonment`

GIVEN p IS A MAYBE Punishment
GIVETH A MAYBE `Mode of proceeding`
`s 320.19 test: the mode of the answer` MEANS
    CONSIDER p
    WHEN JUST q THEN JUST (q's `mode`)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

GIVEN p IS A Punishment
GIVETH A `Mode of proceeding`
`s 320.19 test: the mode of the limb` MEANS p's `mode`

-- A stand-in for the INPUT "the general penalty of section 787(1)" (Part XXVII, another part): the figures are arbitrary and are chosen only to show that the input is returned unchanged.
`s 787(1) test: a stand-in general penalty` MEANS Punishment WITH
    `mode` IS `on summary conviction`
    `maximum imprisonment` IS `imprisonment for a term of` `ninety days`
    `minimum imprisonment` IS `no imprisonment is stated`
    `maximum fine` IS `a fine of` 777
    `minimum fine` IS `no fine is stated`

`s 320.19 test: first` MEANS `s 320.19 a first offence`
`s 320.19 test: second` MEANS `s 320.19 a second offence`
`s 320.19 test: subsequent` MEANS `s 320.19 a subsequent offence`
`s 320.19 test: ten years` MEANS `imprisonment for a term of` `ten years`
`s 320.19 test: fourteen years` MEANS `imprisonment for a term of` `fourteen years`
`s 320.19 test: two years less a day` MEANS `imprisonment for a term of` `two years less a day`
`s 320.19 test: 30 days` MEANS `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 0, 0, 30, FALSE)
`s 320.19 test: 120 days` MEANS `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 0, 0, 120, FALSE)

§ `s 320.19(1)(a) and (b): offences under 320.14(1) or 320.15(1): maximum, and the minimum by occasion (first: a fine of $1,000; second: 30 days; subsequent: 120 days), in both limbs`
#ASSERT `s 320.19 test: the minimum fine of the limb` (`s 320.19(1)(a) the punishment on indictment for an offence under subsection 320.14(1) or 320.15(1)` `s 320.19 a first offence`) EQUALS `a fine of` 1000   -- (a)(i) first offence
#ASSERT `s 320.19 test: the minimum imprisonment of the limb` (`s 320.19(1)(a) the punishment on indictment for an offence under subsection 320.14(1) or 320.15(1)` `s 320.19 a first offence`) EQUALS `no imprisonment is stated`   -- (a)(i): the minimum for a first offence is a fine only
#ASSERT `s 320.19 test: the maximum imprisonment of the limb` (`s 320.19(1)(a) the punishment on indictment for an offence under subsection 320.14(1) or 320.15(1)` `s 320.19 a first offence`) EQUALS `imprisonment for a term of` `ten years`   -- (a) not more than 10 years
#ASSERT `s 320.19 test: the minimum imprisonment of the limb` (`s 320.19(1)(a) the punishment on indictment for an offence under subsection 320.14(1) or 320.15(1)` `s 320.19 a second offence`) EQUALS `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 0, 0, 30, FALSE)   -- (a)(ii) second offence: 30 days
#ASSERT `s 320.19 test: the minimum fine of the limb` (`s 320.19(1)(a) the punishment on indictment for an offence under subsection 320.14(1) or 320.15(1)` `s 320.19 a second offence`) EQUALS `no fine is stated`   -- (a)(ii): no minimum fine is stated for a second offence
#ASSERT `s 320.19 test: the minimum imprisonment of the limb` (`s 320.19(1)(a) the punishment on indictment for an offence under subsection 320.14(1) or 320.15(1)` `s 320.19 a subsequent offence`) EQUALS `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 0, 0, 120, FALSE)   -- (a)(iii) each subsequent offence: 120 days
#ASSERT `s 320.19 test: the mode of the limb` (`s 320.19(1)(a) the punishment on indictment for an offence under subsection 320.14(1) or 320.15(1)` `s 320.19 a first offence`) EQUALS `by indictment`   -- (a) is the indictable limb
#ASSERT `s 320.19 test: the maximum fine of the limb` (`s 320.19(1)(b) the punishment on summary conviction for an offence under subsection 320.14(1) or 320.15(1)` `s 320.19 a first offence`) EQUALS `a fine of` 5000   -- (b) a fine of not more than $5,000
#ASSERT `s 320.19 test: the maximum imprisonment of the limb` (`s 320.19(1)(b) the punishment on summary conviction for an offence under subsection 320.14(1) or 320.15(1)` `s 320.19 a first offence`) EQUALS `imprisonment for a term of` `two years less a day`   -- (b) imprisonment of not more than two years less a day
#ASSERT `s 320.19 test: the minimum fine of the limb` (`s 320.19(1)(b) the punishment on summary conviction for an offence under subsection 320.14(1) or 320.15(1)` `s 320.19 a first offence`) EQUALS `a fine of` 1000   -- (b)(i)
#ASSERT `s 320.19 test: the minimum imprisonment of the limb` (`s 320.19(1)(b) the punishment on summary conviction for an offence under subsection 320.14(1) or 320.15(1)` `s 320.19 a second offence`) EQUALS `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 0, 0, 30, FALSE)   -- (b)(ii)
#ASSERT `s 320.19 test: the minimum imprisonment of the limb` (`s 320.19(1)(b) the punishment on summary conviction for an offence under subsection 320.14(1) or 320.15(1)` `s 320.19 a subsequent offence`) EQUALS `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 0, 0, 120, FALSE)   -- (b)(iii)
#ASSERT `s 320.19 test: the mode of the limb` (`s 320.19(1)(b) the punishment on summary conviction for an offence under subsection 320.14(1) or 320.15(1)` `s 320.19 a first offence`) EQUALS `on summary conviction`   -- (b) is the summary conviction limb
#ASSERT `s 320.19 test: the minimum imprisonment of the limb` (`s 320.19(1) the punishment for an offence under subsection 320.14(1) or 320.15(1)` `by indictment` `s 320.19 a subsequent offence`) EQUALS `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 0, 0, 120, FALSE)   -- the composition picks the indictable limb for the mode
#ASSERT `s 320.19 test: the maximum fine of the limb` (`s 320.19(1) the punishment for an offence under subsection 320.14(1) or 320.15(1)` `on summary conviction` `s 320.19 a second offence`) EQUALS `a fine of` 5000   -- the composition picks the summary limb for the mode

§ `s 320.19(2): an offence under 320.14(4) is liable on summary conviction to a fine of not more than $1,000`
#ASSERT `s 320.19 test: the maximum fine of the answer` (`s 320.19(2) the punishment for an offence under subsection 320.14(4)` `on summary conviction`) EQUALS JUST (`a fine of` 1000)   -- the maximum fine
#ASSERT `s 320.19 test: the maximum imprisonment of the answer` (`s 320.19(2) the punishment for an offence under subsection 320.14(4)` `on summary conviction`) EQUALS JUST (`no imprisonment is stated`)   -- no imprisonment is stated
#ASSERT `s 320.19 test: the mode of the answer` (`s 320.19(2) the punishment for an offence under subsection 320.14(4)` `on summary conviction`) EQUALS JUST (`on summary conviction`)   -- the limb is summary only
#ASSERT `s 320.19 test: the minimum fine of the answer` (`s 320.19(2) the punishment for an offence under subsection 320.14(4)` `by indictment`) EQUALS NOTHING   -- no indictable limb is stated: not covered

§ `s 320.19(3): despite (1)(a)(i) and (b)(i), a first offence under paragraph 320.14(1)(b): a fine of not less than $1,500 at 120 mg up to under 160 mg, and not less than $2,000 at 160 mg and over`
#ASSERT `s 320.19(3) the minimum fine for a first offence under paragraph 320.14(1)(b)` 120 EQUALS JUST (`a fine of` 1500)   -- exactly 120: "equal to or exceeds 120"
#ASSERT `s 320.19(3) the minimum fine for a first offence under paragraph 320.14(1)(b)` 119.9 EQUALS NOTHING   -- below 120: the subsection says nothing, the $1,000 of (1) stands
#ASSERT `s 320.19(3) the minimum fine for a first offence under paragraph 320.14(1)(b)` 159.9 EQUALS JUST (`a fine of` 1500)   -- under 160
#ASSERT `s 320.19(3) the minimum fine for a first offence under paragraph 320.14(1)(b)` 160 EQUALS JUST (`a fine of` 2000)   -- exactly 160
#ASSERT `s 320.19(3) the minimum fine for a first offence under paragraph 320.14(1)(b)` 300 EQUALS JUST (`a fine of` 2000)   -- well over 160
#ASSERT `s 320.19(3) the minimum fine for a first offence under paragraph 320.14(1)(b)` 80 EQUALS NOTHING   -- at the offence threshold only: not covered by (3)

§ `s 320.19(4): despite (1)(a)(i) and (b)(i), a first offence under 320.15(1): a fine of not less than $2,000`
#ASSERT `s 320.19(4) the minimum fine for a first offence under subsection 320.15(1)` `s 320.19 a first offence` EQUALS JUST (`a fine of` 2000)   -- a first offence
#ASSERT `s 320.19(4) the minimum fine for a first offence under subsection 320.15(1)` `s 320.19 a second offence` EQUALS NOTHING   -- the subsection is limited to "a first offence"
#ASSERT `s 320.19(4) the minimum fine for a first offence under subsection 320.15(1)` `s 320.19 a subsequent offence` EQUALS NOTHING   -- the subsection is limited to "a first offence"

§ `s 320.19(5): offences under 320.13(1), 320.16(1), 320.17 and 320.18(1): indictable (not more than 10 years) or summary conviction (no penalty stated: the general penalty of s 787(1) is an input)`
#ASSERT `s 320.19 test: the maximum imprisonment of the limb` (`s 320.19(5) the punishment for an offence under subsection 320.13(1) or 320.16(1), section 320.17 or subsection 320.18(1)` `by indictment` `s 787(1) test: a stand-in general penalty`) EQUALS `imprisonment for a term of` `ten years`   -- (a)
#ASSERT `s 320.19 test: the minimum fine of the limb` (`s 320.19(5) the punishment for an offence under subsection 320.13(1) or 320.16(1), section 320.17 or subsection 320.18(1)` `by indictment` `s 787(1) test: a stand-in general penalty`) EQUALS `no fine is stated`   -- (a) states no minimum
#ASSERT `s 320.19 test: the maximum fine of the limb` (`s 320.19(5) the punishment for an offence under subsection 320.13(1) or 320.16(1), section 320.17 or subsection 320.18(1)` `on summary conviction` `s 787(1) test: a stand-in general penalty`) EQUALS `a fine of` 777   -- (b): the input s 787(1) penalty is what applies
#ASSERT `s 320.19 test: the maximum imprisonment of the limb` (`s 320.19(5) the punishment for an offence under subsection 320.13(1) or 320.16(1), section 320.17 or subsection 320.18(1)` `on summary conviction` `s 787(1) test: a stand-in general penalty`) EQUALS `imprisonment for a term of` `ninety days`   -- (b): the input is returned unchanged

