#ASSERT `s 320.19 test: the maximum imprisonment of the limb` (`s 320.2 the punishment for an offence under subsection 320.13(2), 320.14(2), 320.15(2) or 320.16(2)` `on summary conviction` `s 320.19 a first offence`) EQUALS `imprisonment for a term of` `two years less a day`   -- (b)
