#ASSERT `s 320.19 test: the maximum imprisonment of the answer` (`s 320.21 the punishment for an offence under subsection 320.13(3), 320.14(3), 320.15(3) or 320.16(3)` `by indictment` `s 320.19 a first offence`) EQUALS JUST (`imprisonment for life`)   -- life
