#ASSERT `s 320.19 test: the minimum imprisonment of the answer` (`s 320.21 the punishment for an offence under subsection 320.13(3), 320.14(3), 320.15(3) or 320.16(3)` `by indictment` `s 320.19 a second offence`) EQUALS JUST (`imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 0, 0, 30, FALSE))   -- (b)
#ASSERT `s 320.19 test: the minimum imprisonment of the answer` (`s 320.21 the punishment for an offence under subsection 320.13(3), 320.14(3), 320.15(3) or 320.16(3)` `by indictment` `s 320.19 a subsequent offence`) EQUALS JUST (`imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 0, 0, 120, FALSE))   -- (c)
