§ `the class of the offence, as the punishing section states it`
#ASSERT `s 320.19 the class of the offence` (`Provision of the Code` OF 320.14, "(1)") EQUALS JUST (`an offence that the section makes both indictable and punishable on summary conviction`)   -- 320.19(1)(a) or (b)
#ASSERT `s 320.19 the class of the offence` (`Provision of the Code` OF 320.14, "(1)(c)") EQUALS JUST (`an offence that the section makes both indictable and punishable on summary conviction`)   -- a paragraph of 320.14(1)
